    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >WISHLIST AND FOLLOW US !</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Slash the Falling Words!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/9e2672b0c02425485faf769e081aff90.poster.avif?t=1749116109\" width=350 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/9e2672b0c02425485faf769e081aff90.webm?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/9e2672b0c02425485faf769e081aff90.mp4?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Type words to slash them before they hit the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Falling Words Come In Unique Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/f5a93b938409744a3bf90992bcf7baad.poster.avif?t=1749116109\" width=350 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/f5a93b938409744a3bf90992bcf7baad.webm?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/f5a93b938409744a3bf90992bcf7baad.mp4?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 10 different mechanics that change how the words fall and behave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use Power-Ups!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/d69b55790129951bc529649cdab4dc6d.poster.avif?t=1749116109\" width=350 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/d69b55790129951bc529649cdab4dc6d.webm?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/d69b55790129951bc529649cdab4dc6d.mp4?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn power-ups every phase and use them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/5ca3f865922f27c394db28fae201eb3c.poster.avif?t=1749116109\" width=350 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/5ca3f865922f27c394db28fae201eb3c.webm?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/5ca3f865922f27c394db28fae201eb3c.mp4?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ boss battles across different game modes and difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/e6d97965892b0f16b110f9b8cf40f889.poster.avif?t=1749116109\" width=350 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/e6d97965892b0f16b110f9b8cf40f889.webm?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/e6d97965892b0f16b110f9b8cf40f889.mp4?t=1749116109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different. Collect gold, upgrade damage, get abilities and passives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Typing Ninja: Story Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/c0c07ce8ff5cb649a97f1f2f74cd03e3.avif?t=1749116109\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow </strong>Hanzo\u2019s story and help him overcome his fear of technology</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Story Levels</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level has 5 difficulty settings</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Story Bosses</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each level has its own mechanics and gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2862700/extras/7d7ec58173dfde050b24df0a27aa2833.avif?t=1749116109\" data-has-big width=800 height=424 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play 6+ survival challenges, </strong>each with its own leaderboard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
